    <string name="about_story">I-Aurorah CAN (Community Action Network) inhlangano yomphakathi ezinikele ekugqugquzeleni ukusekelwa komphakathi, ukuhlinzeka ngosizo olubalulekile, ukuphepha kokudla, usizo lwemfundo, nezinsiza zezempilo emindenini entulayo.</string>
